From pline.c, cmd.c, apply.c, zap.c, fountain.c, & potion.c

                       From potion     From wand
Alignment value        or fountain     or stethescope

>=20                   piously         piously
>13                    devoutly        devoutly
>8                     fervently       fervently
>3                     stridently      stridently
=3                     -               -
>=1                                    haltingly
>0                     haltingly
=0                     nominally       nominally
<0                                     insufficiently
>=-3                   strayed
>=-8                   sinned
<-8                    transgressed

You need alignment >=20 to start the quest (piously aligned)

